---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="EUROCERT | Energy Audit Services - Optimize Energy, Reduce Costs"
  description="Identify energy losses, improve efficiency, and reduce operational costs with our expert energy audit solutions for industries and commercial facilities."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/energy-audit/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[56vh] pt-12 pb-24 lg:pt-20 overflow-x-hidden"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784093229/energy_cjuos1.png" alt="Energy audit services background" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" decoding="async" fetchPriority="high" loading="eager"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]/75"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,rgba(212,168,67,0.18),transparent_55%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 container mx-auto px-6 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center"><div class="text-center lg:text-left"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-2 px-4 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/10 text-eurogold-400 text-xs heading-font font-bold mb-6 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]"><i class="fas fa-industry" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="hidden sm:inline">Industrial &amp; commercial</span><span class="sm:hidden">Industry &amp; commerce</span><span class="text-white/80">·</span><i class="fas fa-chart-line" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Consumption insight</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl xl:text-6xl font-bold text-white leading-[1.08] mb-5 tracking-tight"><span class="block">Energy Audit <span class="text-eurogold-400">Services</span></span><span class="block mt-3 text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl xl:text-[2.25rem] text-white/95 font-semibold tracking-tight">Optimize Energy, Reduce Costs &amp; Improve Efficiency</span></h1><p class="text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-white/75 mb-10 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 font-medium">Identify energy losses, improve efficiency, and reduce operational costs with our expert energy audit solutions for industries and commercial facilities.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4"><a class="w-full sm:w-auto px-10 py-5 bg-eurogold-400 text-[#031022] rounded-2xl heading-font font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.15em] hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3" href="/contact/">Get Free Consultation <i class="fas fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a><button type="button" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-10 py-5 bg-transparent border-2 border-white/25 text-white rounded-2xl heading-font font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.15em] hover:bg-white/10 transition-all">Request Audit Now</button></div></div><div class="w-full aspect-square bg-white/10 rounded-[3rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-[12px] border-white/20 relative isolate"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782368032/eurocert/e1.webp.webp" alt="Industrial facility and energy monitoring - plant systems and consumption dashboards" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-slate-900/50 via-transparent to-transparent"></div><div class="ea-hero-flow-sheen" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/85 via-black/40 to-transparent pt-20 pb-5 px-5 sm:px-8"><p class="text-center text-[11px] sm:text-xs heading-font font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-eurogold-400/95 mb-1">Plant · metering · dashboards</p><p class="text-center text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/80 leading-snug">Industrial operations, energy-flow visibility, and consumption insight - from the shop floor to decision-ready reporting.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white border-b border-slate-100" aria-labelledby="ea-what-is-heading"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-14 items-center"><div class="lg:col-span-5"><h2 id="ea-what-is-heading" class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-5 tracking-tight">What is an Energy Audit?</h2><p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">An Energy Audit is a systematic inspection, monitoring, and analysis of energy consumption within a facility to identify inefficiencies and recommend improvements for cost savings and performance optimization.</p><p class="heading-font text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-euro-700 font-bold mb-4">It helps organizations understand:</p><div class="space-y-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-4 py-3"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-euro-600"></i><span class="text-slate-700 font-medium">Where energy is being used</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-4 py-3"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-euro-600"></i><span class="text-slate-700 font-medium">Where energy is being wasted</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-4 py-3"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-euro-600"></i><span class="text-slate-700 font-medium">How to reduce consumption without affecting output</span></div></div></div><div class="w-full lg:col-span-7"><div class="rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/60"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784093441/en1_garbro.png" alt="Energy audit overview - benefits and process at a glance" class="block w-full h-auto" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 58vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 mt-14 md:mt-16 max-w-5xl border-t border-slate-200 pt-12 md:pt-14"><h3 id="ea-compliance-standards-heading" class="heading-font text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-center text-slate-900 mb-8 md:mb-10">Compliance &amp; standards</h3><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] p-6 text-center"><i class="fas fa-scale-balanced text-2xl text-euro-600 mb-3" aria-hidden="true"></i><p class="text-slate-800 font-semibold text-sm leading-snug">Energy Conservation Act (India)</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] p-6 text-center"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-2xl text-euro-600 mb-3" aria-hidden="true"></i><p class="text-slate-800 font-semibold text-sm leading-snug">ISO 50001 - Energy management systems</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] p-6 text-center"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-list text-2xl text-euro-600 mb-3" aria-hidden="true"></i><p class="text-slate-800 font-semibold text-sm leading-snug">Bureau of Energy Efficiency (BEE) guidelines</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-[#030a16] relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.12)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="relative z-10 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-10"><h2 class="heading-font text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Why Energy Audits Are Critical</h2></div><div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-10"><div class="rounded-3xl border-4 border-eurogold-400 shadow-[0_0_0_2px_rgba(212,168,67,0.25),0_0_40px_rgba(212,168,67,0.2)] overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><video class="w-full aspect-video block bg-black" autoPlay="" loop="" muted="" playsInline="" controls="" preload="metadata" poster="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782368032/eurocert/e1.webp.webp"><source src="/ee1.mp4" type="video/mp4"/>Your browser does not support the video tag.</video></div></div><div class="relative z-10 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-red-500/30 bg-red-500/10 p-8"><h3 class="heading-font text-xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-5">Unchecked energy inefficiencies often lead to:</h3><div class="space-y-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white/85"><i class="fas fa-triangle-exclamation text-red-500"></i><span class="font-medium">Excessive electricity and fuel costs</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white/85"><i class="fas fa-triangle-exclamation text-red-500"></i><span class="font-medium">Overloaded and underperforming equipment</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white/85"><i class="fas fa-triangle-exclamation text-red-500"></i><span class="font-medium">Poor power quality and system instability</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white/85"><i class="fas fa-triangle-exclamation text-red-500"></i><span class="font-medium">Increased carbon emissions</span></div></div></div><div class="rounded-3xl border border-green-500/30 bg-green-500/10 p-8"><h3 class="heading-font text-xl font-bold text-green-400 mb-5">A professionally conducted energy audit enables organizations to:</h3><div class="space-y-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white/85"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-600"></i><span class="font-medium">Reduce energy costs by 10"30%</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white/85"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-600"></i><span class="font-medium">Improve operational reliability</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white/85"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-600"></i><span class="font-medium">Enhance asset life cycle</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white/85"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-600"></i><span class="font-medium">Achieve regulatory and sustainability targets</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100" aria-labelledby="ea-why-important-heading"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-6xl grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-14 items-center"><div class="lg:col-span-5"><h2 id="ea-why-important-heading" class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-6 text-center lg:text-left">Why Energy Audit is Important</h2><p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-5 text-center lg:text-left">Energy is one of the largest operational expenses for industries and commercial buildings. Without proper monitoring, a significant portion of energy is wasted due to inefficiencies.</p><p class="heading-font text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-euro-700 font-bold mb-4 text-center lg:text-left">An energy audit helps:</p><ul class="space-y-3"><li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-4 py-3 text-slate-700 font-medium"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-euro-600 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i>Identify energy-saving opportunities</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-4 py-3 text-slate-700 font-medium"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-euro-600 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i>Reduce electricity and fuel costs</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-4 py-3 text-slate-700 font-medium"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-euro-600 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i>Improve system performance</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-4 py-3 text-slate-700 font-medium"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-euro-600 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i>Lower carbon footprint</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-4 py-3 text-slate-700 font-medium"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-euro-600 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i>Enhance sustainability goals</li></ul></div><div class="w-full lg:col-span-7"><div class="rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 shadow-lg shadow-slate-200/50"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367588/eurocert/EO.png.png" alt="Why an energy audit is important - energy use, savings, and sustainability context" class="block w-full h-auto" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div></div></div></section><section id="case-studies" class="scroll-mt-24 border-t-4 border-eurogold-400/40 py-24 md:py-28 bg-[#020812] text-white relative overflow-hidden isolate"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0" aria-hidden="true"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 20% 0%, rgba(212,168,67,0.14), transparent 50%)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 45% at 80% 100%, rgba(212,168,67,0.08), transparent 45%)"></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(3,10,22,0.4)_0%,transparent_35%,rgba(0,0,0,0.35)_100%)]" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative z-10 container mx-auto px-6 max-w-6xl"><div class="text-center mb-14 md:mb-16"><p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-eurogold-400 heading-font text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-4"><i class="fas fa-gem text-[10px]" aria-hidden="true"></i>Case Studies</p><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-tight">Real Results from Our Energy Audits</h2></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-10"><article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-eurogold-400/25 bg-[#0a1628] p-8 md:p-10 shadow-[0_24px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.45)] hover:border-eurogold-400/45 transition-colors"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 mb-6"><span class="mt-1 flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/15 border border-eurogold-400/35 text-eurogold-400" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fas fa-thumbtack text-sm"></i></span><div><h3 class="heading-font text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white leading-snug">Case Study 1 - Manufacturing facility</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-eurogold-400/95 font-semibold">Client Type: <span class="text-white/90 font-medium">Industrial production</span></p></div></div><div class="space-y-6 text-sm md:text-[15px] leading-relaxed"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/45 font-bold mb-2">Problem</h4><p class="text-white/85">Rising electricity costs and frequent motor failures</p></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/45 font-bold mb-2">Key findings</h4><ul class="space-y-2 text-white/80"><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-eurogold-400 shrink-0">•<span>Low power factor</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-eurogold-400 shrink-0">•<span>Oversized motors at low efficiency</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-eurogold-400 shrink-0">•<span>High idle energy consumption</span></li></ul></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/45 font-bold mb-2">Solution provided</h4><ul class="space-y-2 text-white/80"><li class="flex gap-2"><i class="fas fa-wrench text-eurogold-400/80 text-xs mt-1 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Power factor correction</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><i class="fas fa-wrench text-eurogold-400/80 text-xs mt-1 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Motor right-sizing</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><i class="fas fa-wrench text-eurogold-400/80 text-xs mt-1 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Load scheduling</span></li></ul></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-green-500/25 bg-green-500/10 px-5 py-4"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-green-400/90 font-bold mb-3">Result</h4><ul class="space-y-2.5"><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-white/90 font-medium"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>22% reduction in energy costs</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-white/90 font-medium"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Improved equipment efficiency</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-white/90 font-medium"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Reduced maintenance issues</span></li></ul></div></div></article><article class="rounded-[2rem] border border-eurogold-400/25 bg-[#0a1628] p-8 md:p-10 shadow-[0_24px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.45)] hover:border-eurogold-400/45 transition-colors"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 mb-6"><span class="mt-1 flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/15 border border-eurogold-400/35 text-eurogold-400" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fas fa-thumbtack text-sm"></i></span><div><h3 class="heading-font text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white leading-snug">Case Study 2 - Commercial infrastructure</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-eurogold-400/95 font-semibold">Client Type: <span class="text-white/90 font-medium">Multi-use commercial complex</span></p></div></div><div class="space-y-6 text-sm md:text-[15px] leading-relaxed"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/45 font-bold mb-2">Problem</h4><p class="text-white/85">Excessive HVAC energy consumption</p></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/45 font-bold mb-2">Key findings</h4><ul class="space-y-2 text-white/80"><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-eurogold-400 shrink-0">•<span>Inefficient cooling cycles</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-eurogold-400 shrink-0">•<span>Poor insulation</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-eurogold-400 shrink-0">•<span>Outdated lighting systems</span></li></ul></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/45 font-bold mb-2">Solution provided</h4><ul class="space-y-2 text-white/80"><li class="flex gap-2"><i class="fas fa-wrench text-eurogold-400/80 text-xs mt-1 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>HVAC optimization</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><i class="fas fa-wrench text-eurogold-400/80 text-xs mt-1 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>LED retrofitting</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><i class="fas fa-wrench text-eurogold-400/80 text-xs mt-1 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Insulation improvements</span></li></ul></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-green-500/25 bg-green-500/10 px-5 py-4"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-green-400/90 font-bold mb-3">Result</h4><ul class="space-y-2.5"><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-white/90 font-medium"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>28% reduction in energy consumption</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-white/90 font-medium"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Improved occupant comfort</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-white/90 font-medium"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Lower operational costs</span></li></ul></div></div></article></div></div></section><section class="py-24 bg-[#f8fafc] border-t border-slate-200/80"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center mb-12"><h2 class="heading-font text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">Our Energy Audit Methodology</h2></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-slate-100"><div class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#030a16] text-eurogold-400 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><i class="fas fa-chart-line text-2xl"></i></div><div class="text-4xl heading-font font-bold text-slate-100 mb-2">01</div><h3 class="text-xl heading-font font-bold mb-3">Preliminary assessment</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Historical bills, major loads, and benchmarking against industry norms.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-slate-100"><div class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#030a16] text-eurogold-400 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><i class="fas fa-building text-2xl"></i></div><div class="text-4xl heading-font font-bold text-slate-100 mb-2">02</div><h3 class="text-xl heading-font font-bold mb-3">Detailed site survey</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Distribution, HVAC, motors, thermal systems, and operating practices.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-slate-100"><div class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#030a16] text-eurogold-400 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><i class="fas fa-wave-square text-2xl"></i></div><div class="text-4xl heading-font font-bold text-slate-100 mb-2">03</div><h3 class="text-xl heading-font font-bold mb-3">Instrumentation &amp; measurements</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Power quality, load analysis, thermography, and leak detection where applicable.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-slate-100"><div class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#030a16] text-eurogold-400 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><i class="fas fa-bolt text-2xl"></i></div><div class="text-4xl heading-font font-bold text-slate-100 mb-2">04</div><h3 class="text-xl heading-font font-bold mb-3">Energy performance analysis</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Demand profiling, power factor, efficiency metrics, and peak penalties.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-slate-100"><div class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#030a16] text-eurogold-400 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><i class="fas fa-leaf text-2xl"></i></div><div class="text-4xl heading-font font-bold text-slate-100 mb-2">05</div><h3 class="text-xl heading-font font-bold mb-3">Energy conservation opportunities</h3><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">ECOs ranked by feasibility, investment, payback, and implementation risk.</p></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-slate-100"><div class="w-16 h-16 bg-[#030a16] text-eurogold-400 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6"><i class="fas fa-file-contract text-2xl"></i></div><div class="text-4xl heading-font font-bold text-slate-100 mb-2">06